    "group": "Carnival of Excess",
    "summary": "Your units are Empowered as follows:\n\n- each of your **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** units, while it is up to 6\" from one of your **LEGIONS OF EXCESS** units\n- each of your **LEGIONS OF EXCESS** units, while it is up to 6\" from one of your **EMPEROR’S CHILDREN** units\n\nWeapons carried by models in an Empowered unit get **[[SUSTAINED HITS 1]](vsdata:weapon-ability/sustained-hits)**. A weapon that already has it scores **Critical Hits** on unmodified [Hit rolls](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) of 5+.",
